  "question": {
    "text": "The moment of inertial of a solid sphere, about an axis parallel to its diameter and at a distance of <math><mi>x</mi></math> from it, is <math><mi>&#8242;</mi><mi>I</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> Which one of the graphs represents the variation of <math><mi>I</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> with <math><mi>x</mi></math> correctly?"
